            "id": "cap_d911b3740aea4093854b9fca9e35dc1f",
            "base_capsule_id": null,
            "state": "ACTIVE",
            "content": "FreetoShop is a local-first browser image editor with a tiled architecture. The engineering goal is to implement a Clone Stamp tool (Milestone 1) with Alt/Option-click source selection, aligned/unaligned modes, selection/mask respect, atomic undoable transactions, and persistence. Milestone 2 adds retouch/paint tools (Healing Brush, Spot Healing, Patch, Dodge/Burn/Smudge/Sponge/Airbrush, Gradient, Paint Bucket, Vibrance). Milestone 3 covers selection, transform, adjustment, and layer workflows. Milestone 4 hardens local-first persistence with partial hydration and recovery. Milestone 5 advances rendering and format compatibility with optional GPU/WebGPU. Milestone 6 finishes the professional shell and hardening. Cross-cutting requirements include bounded region processing, copy-on-write, testable data models, and real browser tests.",
